// Golden canonical-genesis ConfigParam30 leaf for Simplex protocol v2.
// Keep this encoding synchronized with crypto/smartcont/gen-zerostate.fif.
// The local test harness (test/tostester/src/tostester/zerostate.py) keeps
// its own first_block_timeout default of 1000 ms.

"Config.fif" include

dictnew
<b 400 32 u, b> <s 0 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 700 32 u, b> <s 1 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 250 32 u, b> <s 10 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 300 32 u, b> <s 13 rot 8 udict! drop
<b x{22} s, 0 5 u, 2 2 u, 1 1 u, 4 32 u, swap dict, b>

hashu 0x131A33C486174558385E855E497FCD8039019F82E43BE9DB953087FFF6C03457
= not abort"unexpected Simplex v2 genesis cell hash"
